(1743974, 235374, 32409, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more focus at the bottom of the picture. Colors are good though.</td>', 'I''d like to see more focus at the bottom of the picture. Colors are good though.', '2005-09-28 01:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
