(1744110, 236746, 25921, '<td valign="top">The barrell distortion in the lens in distracting.  I know you can''t do anything about that, so in consideration of this, I say, great exposure, good composition, and a pleasing image overall. 6.</td>', 'The barrell distortion in the lens in distracting.  I know you can''t do anything about that, so in consideration of this, I say, great exposure, good composition, and a pleasing image overall. 6.', '2005-09-28 02:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
