(1744732, 236183, 33732, '<td valign="top">Seems like the camera needed to be next to the grass or on the beach.  Beauty of a shot.  More light would give some color to all the green.</td>', 'Seems like the camera needed to be next to the grass or on the beach.  Beauty of a shot.  More light would give some color to all the green.', '2005-09-28 09:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744734, 237247, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot.  The color and texture variations add interest.  My main complaint is that the window frame isn''t parallel with the bottom of the photo''s line. It could be easily remedied by straightening out the shot. With the subject being farther away, it might be difficult, but I wish she were a tad bit more focused. Love the turquoise shutters!</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot.  The color and texture variations add interest.  My main complaint is that the window frame isn''t parallel with the bottom of the photo''s line. It could be easily remedied by straightening out the shot. With the subject being farther away, it might be difficult, but I wish she were a tad bit more focused. Love the turquoise shutters!', '2005-09-28 09:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744741, 237380, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the illuminated arch''s golden color against the vivid blue sky. Nice color contrast. The detail of the wording and the statue is well done too. The perspective is unusual and interesting to the ey.</td>', 'I like the illuminated arch''s golden color against the vivid blue sky. Nice color contrast. The detail of the wording and the statue is well done too. The perspective is unusual and interesting to the ey.', '2005-09-28 09:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744743, 236023, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal sense of this in combination with the single color saturation. It adds an urban edge to it.</td>', 'I like the diagonal sense of this in combination with the single color saturation. It adds an urban edge to it.', '2005-09-28 09:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744749, 236158, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this with the yellow contrasting the blue but I feel as if I''m not on the ground but level with the higher part of the tree. I''d like to see part of the trunk as you shoot up to give more perspective.  the clouds are wonderful.</td>', 'I love the idea of this with the yellow contrasting the blue but I feel as if I''m not on the ground but level with the higher part of the tree. I''d like to see part of the trunk as you shoot up to give more perspective.  the clouds are wonderful.', '2005-09-28 09:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744752, 237025, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL  That guy is SO happy to be a viking. hee hee  Thanks for the chuckle.  Technically, not the best photo, but I do like the colors and the lattice grid.  AND you did shoot from the ground up, unlike so many others that don''t have near the perspective as this one.</td>', 'LOL  That guy is SO happy to be a viking. hee hee  Thanks for the chuckle.  Technically, not the best photo, but I do like the colors and the lattice grid.  AND you did shoot from the ground up, unlike so many others that don''t have near the perspective as this one.', '2005-09-28 09:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744754, 235247, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I like the golden orange tones against the vivid blue. It loses some of the sense of being from the ground having been shot from this angle. I''d like the lens looking directly up at the flower, not to the side of it.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I like the golden orange tones against the vivid blue. It loses some of the sense of being from the ground having been shot from this angle. I''d like the lens looking directly up at the flower, not to the side of it.', '2005-09-28 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744765, 236495, 33732, '<td valign="top">You had clouds.  I was there a week and only had one day with clouds.  I may have stood here and taken a photo.  You can see the rainbow if you move and wait on sunset.  The lower part is dark</td>', 'You had clouds.  I was there a week and only had one day with clouds.  I may have stood here and taken a photo.  You can see the rainbow if you move and wait on sunset.  The lower part is dark', '2005-09-28 09:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744781, 236303, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great graphic sense to it. I like the architecture.  Black and white is the perfect choice although there is alot of gray tones and not as much pure black and white.</td>', 'Great graphic sense to it. I like the architecture.  Black and white is the perfect choice although there is alot of gray tones and not as much pure black and white.', '2005-09-28 09:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744799, 236799, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - I''m hearing "I''m alright, nobody worry ''bout me" by Kenny Loggins.  "Here we are, at August - Cinderella story out of nowhere."  Man, I love that movie.  <br/> <br/>This has great perspective and the composition is good. The grass is tack sharp. I think I''d like to see the ball and club more focused. Overall - good job. And thanks for reminding me of one of my favorite comedies!</td>', 'HEE HEE - I''m hearing "I''m alright, nobody worry ''bout me" by Kenny Loggins.  "Here we are, at August - Cinderella story out of nowhere."  Man, I love that movie.   This has great perspective and the composition is good. The grass is tack sharp. I think I''d like to see the ball and club more focused. Overall - good job. And thanks for reminding me of one of my favorite comedies!', '2005-09-28 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744803, 237255, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has lovely coloration and great DOF, but I don''t have the sense that you are shooting up. It seems more of a sideways shot from across the pond and not from the water toward the sky.</td>', 'This has lovely coloration and great DOF, but I don''t have the sense that you are shooting up. It seems more of a sideways shot from across the pond and not from the water toward the sky.', '2005-09-28 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744806, 236797, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the blown out sense of this. The symmetry really works as well.  This is unusual and I like it.</td>', 'I like the blown out sense of this. The symmetry really works as well.  This is unusual and I like it.', '2005-09-28 09:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744812, 235772, 15711, '<td valign="top">THis has great potential, but being in shadow, it loses something without the sharp contrast of black and white.  THis is more gray feeling. I like the symmetry. It almost looks like a face.</td>', 'THis has great potential, but being in shadow, it loses something without the sharp contrast of black and white.  THis is more gray feeling. I like the symmetry. It almost looks like a face.', '2005-09-28 09:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744834, 236959, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrast and the texture of the old stone arch, but I''m missing the tack sharp focus that would really make it a stand out.</td>', 'I like the color contrast and the texture of the old stone arch, but I''m missing the tack sharp focus that would really make it a stand out.', '2005-09-28 09:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744835, 235168, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and geometric! I like all of the vivid colors.  Very interesting and unexpected.</td>', 'Very abstract and geometric! I like all of the vivid colors.  Very interesting and unexpected.', '2005-09-28 09:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744841, 237308, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOF. It seems a touch busy with the other leaf up and to the left from the pine cones. I think I''d crop out part of the area behind the biker or maybe the area to the left of the leaf.  I would like to see just a little area in front of the pinecones instead of them being cropped so close to the bottom.</td>', 'Interesting DOF. It seems a touch busy with the other leaf up and to the left from the pine cones. I think I''d crop out part of the area behind the biker or maybe the area to the left of the leaf.  I would like to see just a little area in front of the pinecones instead of them being cropped so close to the bottom.', '2005-09-28 09:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744847, 237374, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE THIS!!!  IT is greatly detailed due to the perfect focus.  The colors of the dog''s coat are a perfect contrast to the rich blue sky.  I might like to see a tad more negative space on one side, but other than that It is really a great shot (oh one more thing: I''d crop out the collar too hee hee) All animal shots get an extra point from me. 8</td>', 'LOVE THIS!!!  IT is greatly detailed due to the perfect focus.  The colors of the dog''s coat are a perfect contrast to the rich blue sky.  I might like to see a tad more negative space on one side, but other than that It is really a great shot (oh one more thing: I''d crop out the collar too hee hee) All animal shots get an extra point from me. 8', '2005-09-28 10:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744851, 235438, 29490, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Now that''s a powerful shot.  Very well done.</td>', 'Wow.  Now that''s a powerful shot.  Very well done.', '2005-09-28 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744857, 235594, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The leaf seems a tad over sharp, but the blossom is very pretty and the detail of the petals is good.</td>', 'Very nice.  The leaf seems a tad over sharp, but the blossom is very pretty and the detail of the petals is good.', '2005-09-28 10:05:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1744862, 235686, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH I like the stark white of the flowers. Interesting. Meets the challenge quite well. The smaller ones are a tad distracting, but I guess Mother Nature intended it that way.</td>', 'OH I like the stark white of the flowers. Interesting. Meets the challenge quite well. The smaller ones are a tad distracting, but I guess Mother Nature intended it that way.', '2005-09-28 10:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744870, 236992, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this but he''s out of focus. :~( I''d like to have the photographer further down so you get more of the ground perspective.</td>', 'I really like this but he''s out of focus. :~( I''d like to have the photographer further down so you get more of the ground perspective.', '2005-09-28 10:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744873, 235215, 8292, '<td valign="top">very sweet, a bit more colour enhancement would''ve made it great. :)</td>', 'very sweet, a bit more colour enhancement would''ve made it great. :)', '2005-09-28 10:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744879, 237290, 8292, '<td valign="top">this made me smile! :)</td>', 'this made me smile! :)', '2005-09-28 10:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744887, 237124, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with good perspective. Suits the challenge perfectly. The sky color is rich and vivid.  Not the most visually beautiful shot, but given what you have here, it''s quite good.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with good perspective. Suits the challenge perfectly. The sky color is rich and vivid.  Not the most visually beautiful shot, but given what you have here, it''s quite good.', '2005-09-28 10:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744892, 235920, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  Love the title.  I wish the image were tack sharp and the sky were more blue. This has great potential!!</td>', 'ROFL  Love the title.  I wish the image were tack sharp and the sky were more blue. This has great potential!!', '2005-09-28 10:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744902, 236795, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this alot.  The flag flying adds a nice touch of movement to the otherwise stationary building.  I think if you adjusted curves, you might be able to really get some snap out of the beige, brown and blue (windows) tones of the building itself.</td>', 'I like the angle of this alot.  The flag flying adds a nice touch of movement to the otherwise stationary building.  I think if you adjusted curves, you might be able to really get some snap out of the beige, brown and blue (windows) tones of the building itself.', '2005-09-28 10:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744911, 236183, 3569, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2005-09-28 10:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744919, 237409, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has fun movement and perspective.  I like the lights against the sky. It certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'This has fun movement and perspective.  I like the lights against the sky. It certainly meets the challenge.', '2005-09-28 10:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744926, 235231, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - Halloween is coming.  Fun and unusual. I like the originality of it alot.</td>', 'HEE HEE - Halloween is coming.  Fun and unusual. I like the originality of it alot.', '2005-09-28 10:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744935, 234688, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the border.</td>', 'I really don''t like the border.', '2005-09-28 10:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744936, 237377, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting. It''s like the ball is suspended in mid air.  I like the roundness of it with the squar geometry of the building.  Cool lighting to make this work.</td>', 'This is really interesting. It''s like the ball is suspended in mid air.  I like the roundness of it with the squar geometry of the building.  Cool lighting to make this work.', '2005-09-28 10:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744940, 235116, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool. I like the sun''s flare. Simple but effective.</td>', 'Cool. I like the sun''s flare. Simple but effective.', '2005-09-28 10:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744945, 236094, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice urban shot. I like the single word title. If the sky were blue it would take on an entirely different viewpoint but with all of the gray tones, it is monochromatic and works well. 7</td>', 'Nice urban shot. I like the single word title. If the sky were blue it would take on an entirely different viewpoint but with all of the gray tones, it is monochromatic and works well. 7', '2005-09-28 10:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744949, 237195, 35545, '<td valign="top">Neat picture. I love the tones and the contrast between the texture of the stone walls and the iron rail.  I wish the boy''s face was sharper.<br/> <br/>P.S. In my storybook, Rapunzel was a girl and she had long golden hair.  I know, I sound like The Title Police.  I didn''t mark you down for that.</td>', 'Neat picture. I love the tones and the contrast between the texture of the stone walls and the iron rail.  I wish the boy''s face was sharper. P.S. In my storybook, Rapunzel was a girl and she had long golden hair.  I know, I sound like The Title Police.  I didn''t mark you down for that.', '2005-09-28 10:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744951, 236199, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great detailing. The sky is a tad blown out, but I like the black and white filter.</td>', 'Great detailing. The sky is a tad blown out, but I like the black and white filter.', '2005-09-28 10:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744954, 234739, 35545, '<td valign="top">Not much feeling of shooting this shot up.</td>', 'Not much feeling of shooting this shot up.', '2005-09-28 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744957, 237314, 35545, '<td valign="top">The picture is too small, and the black border kills it.  Can''t argue with the subject matter.</td>', 'The picture is too small, and the black border kills it.  Can''t argue with the subject matter.', '2005-09-28 10:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744958, 236101, 40580, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus.  Why the tilt?</td>', 'Seems out of focus.  Why the tilt?', '2005-09-28 10:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744963, 236736, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure B&amp;W was the best choice for this.  The background is so busy that the subject gets lost in it.  It might have been better in color.  It might have been easier to see if the picture was larger.</td>', 'I''m not sure B&W was the best choice for this.  The background is so busy that the subject gets lost in it.  It might have been better in color.  It might have been easier to see if the picture was larger.', '2005-09-28 10:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744967, 235642, 41277, '<td valign="top">Excellent eye!!! great point of view...<br/>well done...<br/>mm..   just one thing... maybe shooting in other time of the day coz then you could have get the sky much more blue.. it all depends where the sun is at that day.. <br/>as i see it.. you probebly shot when the sun was on your left..  too close to the building..</td>', 'Excellent eye!!! great point of view...well done...mm..   just one thing... maybe shooting in other time of the day coz then you could have get the sky much more blue.. it all depends where the sun is at that day.. as i see it.. you probebly shot when the sun was on your left..  too close to the building..', '2005-09-28 10:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744968, 237101, 15711, '<td valign="top">Spelling police here - would that be CHURCH?? hee hee<br/> <br/>I like the perspective and the angles of the building. The light blows it out a bit, but maybe you could do some post editing to fix that.</td>', 'Spelling police here - would that be CHURCH?? hee hee I like the perspective and the angles of the building. The light blows it out a bit, but maybe you could do some post editing to fix that.', '2005-09-28 10:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744971, 236129, 41277, '<td valign="top">Amazing.. <br/>great sharp photo.. i know its not easy to get all the jiraf in focus.. youv done well here..</td>', 'Amazing.. great sharp photo.. i know its not easy to get all the jiraf in focus.. youv done well here..', '2005-09-28 10:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744973, 237054, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice intense colors. The contrast of them is good. Tack sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice intense colors. The contrast of them is good. Tack sharp focus.', '2005-09-28 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744975, 235168, 41277, '<td valign="top">mmmm.. its messy... i like it</td>', 'mmmm.. its messy... i like it', '2005-09-28 10:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744979, 237068, 35545, '<td valign="top">If he was really upside down, his hair wouldn''t be so neat.  It looks as if all you did was rotate a regular snapshot 180 degrees. Really doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'If he was really upside down, his hair wouldn''t be so neat.  It looks as if all you did was rotate a regular snapshot 180 degrees. Really doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2005-09-28 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1744981, 237021, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a capture. I wish it was tack sharp though. The sky color would be great if you''d adjust the cyan and bring it up a bit.</td>', 'Wow - what a capture. I wish it was tack sharp though. The sky color would be great if you''d adjust the cyan and bring it up a bit.', '2005-09-28 10:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
