(1745002, 237360, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish he had better lighting.  I can''t appreciate his beautiful coat because it''s too dark. Great perspective. Maybe work with curves and bright and contrast to up the color  a bit.</td>', 'I wish he had better lighting.  I can''t appreciate his beautiful coat because it''s too dark. Great perspective. Maybe work with curves and bright and contrast to up the color  a bit.', '2005-09-28 10:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745006, 237221, 35545, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  The child''s left foot is completely gone in the shadow and we only see a white blob.  The black border doesn''t help matters.</td>', 'Too dark.  The child''s left foot is completely gone in the shadow and we only see a white blob.  The black border doesn''t help matters.', '2005-09-28 10:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745010, 237170, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good cat picture, but things need to be sharper.</td>', 'Good cat picture, but things need to be sharper.', '2005-09-28 10:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
