(1745031, 235863, 35545, '<td valign="top">Aaaargh.  Too bad about the phone lines in the background.  Is that a fountain behind her?  The folds in the dress look like continuations of the phone lines at first glance.  This might have worked better if you had waited a couple of minutes for more light so the woman isn''t in such a deep shadow.</td>', 'Aaaargh.  Too bad about the phone lines in the background.  Is that a fountain behind her?  The folds in the dress look like continuations of the phone lines at first glance.  This might have worked better if you had waited a couple of minutes for more light so the woman isn''t in such a deep shadow.', '2005-09-28 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745037, 237128, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMHO this is a really good close-up (macro?), but it''s so close-up, that we lose all feeling of up and down.</td>', 'IMHO this is a really good close-up (macro?), but it''s so close-up, that we lose all feeling of up and down.', '2005-09-28 10:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745044, 235762, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMHO you need to crop a lot of the top off and emphasize the turtles.  Also, this doesn''t give me any feeling that you have shot from the ground up.  It looks to me like you are looking down on the turtles.</td>', 'IMHO you need to crop a lot of the top off and emphasize the turtles.  Also, this doesn''t give me any feeling that you have shot from the ground up.  It looks to me like you are looking down on the turtles.', '2005-09-28 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
