(1745365, 235849, 18677, '<td valign="top">Great colors!!  Good placement of the sun.  You''ll probably lose a lot of points on the crooked horizon, and the border would look better if you used a hard line instead of an anti-aliased one.  The clouds look a slight bit soft &amp; noisy, but the foreground is in good focus.  A longer exposure to smooth out the water surface would''ve been cool.  The blue sky above the orange sunset helps give it a great feeling of "looking up".  Nice job.</td>', 'Great colors!!  Good placement of the sun.  You''ll probably lose a lot of points on the crooked horizon, and the border would look better if you used a hard line instead of an anti-aliased one.  The clouds look a slight bit soft & noisy, but the foreground is in good focus.  A longer exposure to smooth out the water surface would''ve been cool.  The blue sky above the orange sunset helps give it a great feeling of "looking up".  Nice job.', '2005-09-28 12:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
