(1745767, 235446, 21362, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot. I wish the background wasn''t that stark white; a nice blue sky with little fluffy clouds would''ve been so nice (I know you can''t control the weather). Otherwise, it''s a really nice perspective with great leading curves, nice color, and a really attractive subject. Good job!</td>', 'This is a really great shot. I wish the background wasn''t that stark white; a nice blue sky with little fluffy clouds would''ve been so nice (I know you can''t control the weather). Otherwise, it''s a really nice perspective with great leading curves, nice color, and a really attractive subject. Good job!', '2005-09-28 15:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
