(1745830, 236479, 43031, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to fit the challenge. Picture is a little washed out. Nice expressions on the kids, but would have been more engaging if they were looking at the camera.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to fit the challenge. Picture is a little washed out. Nice expressions on the kids, but would have been more engaging if they were looking at the camera.', '2005-09-28 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745837, 237114, 21362, '<td valign="top">This was a good take on the theme. I dislike the feet/objects showing in the upper right part of the frame - they are very distracting. I think it''s better with them cropped off. Better yet would''ve been a pair of feet more fully in the photo, really driving home the concept of having the ground and sky in one single plane.<br/> <br/>It''s good though, thanks for entering this.</td>', 'This was a good take on the theme. I dislike the feet/objects showing in the upper right part of the frame - they are very distracting. I think it''s better with them cropped off. Better yet would''ve been a pair of feet more fully in the photo, really driving home the concept of having the ground and sky in one single plane. It''s good though, thanks for entering this.', '2005-09-28 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745861, 235116, 30049, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on finding a unique perspective for this challenge.  By incorporating the grass (sand dunes I take it) you''ve identified ground level.  The sun coming thru below the grassline is very cool, I like the starburst.  Nice use of angles to offset the blue - focus really isn''t a major issue with an image like this - exposure &amp; lighting are very good.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Congratulations on finding a unique perspective for this challenge.  By incorporating the grass (sand dunes I take it) you''ve identified ground level.  The sun coming thru below the grassline is very cool, I like the starburst.  Nice use of angles to offset the blue - focus really isn''t a major issue with an image like this - exposure & lighting are very good.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2005-09-28 16:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745867, 235250, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok - I needed a title here to figure out what it is.  That''s fine, it''s a great image.  Funky looking drinking fountain.  This has a bit of an abstract feel to it and you''ve done a great job in composing it!  The falling water drops add a sense of movement and give you a sense of being there.  Hope you didn''t get your camera wet!  ;^)  Congrats and good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Ok - I needed a title here to figure out what it is.  That''s fine, it''s a great image.  Funky looking drinking fountain.  This has a bit of an abstract feel to it and you''ve done a great job in composing it!  The falling water drops add a sense of movement and give you a sense of being there.  Hope you didn''t get your camera wet!  ;^)  Congrats and good luck on the challenge.', '2005-09-28 16:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745871, 237143, 16438, '<td valign="top">ewwwwwwwwwwwwwww!!!!!!!!  great shot</td>', 'ewwwwwwwwwwwwwww!!!!!!!!  great shot', '2005-09-28 16:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745875, 237209, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I love your take on the challenge theme.  I don''t know if you rotated on purpose to lose something in the image upper left, or if you did it intentionally to add a unique feel to the photo.  Either way it works.  B/W is the best choice here as the green in the background trees would have been distracting.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is great!  I love your take on the challenge theme.  I don''t know if you rotated on purpose to lose something in the image upper left, or if you did it intentionally to add a unique feel to the photo.  Either way it works.  B/W is the best choice here as the green in the background trees would have been distracting.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-28 16:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745880, 237372, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of diagonal lines in your composition.  Sky looks good for color.  The image is crisp, well focused, and exposed.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice use of diagonal lines in your composition.  Sky looks good for color.  The image is crisp, well focused, and exposed.  Good work.', '2005-09-28 16:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745891, 237352, 30049, '<td valign="top">Many, MANY, tree shots in this challenge.  You did great with this one!  The way you composed this with the main tree going from bottom right to center does a wonderful job of leading the viewer to the top of the trees and into that rich blue sky.  I can almost picture myself being there.  Nice job on a simple subject.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Many, MANY, tree shots in this challenge.  You did great with this one!  The way you composed this with the main tree going from bottom right to center does a wonderful job of leading the viewer to the top of the trees and into that rich blue sky.  I can almost picture myself being there.  Nice job on a simple subject.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-28 16:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745907, 236483, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image of joy and happiness.  I like the coloration job you''ve done with it.  My only complaint is I''m not seeing the connection to the challenge with the camera angle (level instead of ground up) and approach you''ve taken. You''ve made some connection I cannot see or feel.  Regardless, I''m sure this will make a nice addition as a family image to cherish forever.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image of joy and happiness.  I like the coloration job you''ve done with it.  My only complaint is I''m not seeing the connection to the challenge with the camera angle (level instead of ground up) and approach you''ve taken. You''ve made some connection I cannot see or feel.  Regardless, I''m sure this will make a nice addition as a family image to cherish forever.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-28 16:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745921, 237329, 9478, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color. I like it very much. But the sky is a bit noisy; I would have tried Neat Image.</td>', 'Nice composition and color. I like it very much. But the sky is a bit noisy; I would have tried Neat Image.', '2005-09-28 16:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745927, 237346, 9478, '<td valign="top">Very good contrast and definition. Good shot!</td>', 'Very good contrast and definition. Good shot!', '2005-09-28 16:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745938, 236102, 30049, '<td valign="top">I get your take on this...the dog doesn''t want to come down the sand dune again. It''s a fun idea and put together ok.  Couple of things that work against this photo is the first impression - the first thing I noticed as it was loading was a fuzzy OOF dog.  That''s because I had to scroll down to see the bottom third of the image. After seeing the whole pic I understand...I''m just saying what popped into my mind at first.  I think something that could have helped sell this is some dog tracks in the sand, especially in the vicinity where the focus is sharp (bottom third of image).  As it is, the strongest part of this image (the sand) doesn''t hold the viewers interest for long.  Creative ideas like this will work for you in the future...maybe it will this time and I''m just being too picky.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I get your take on this...the dog doesn''t want to come down the sand dune again. It''s a fun idea and put together ok.  Couple of things that work against this photo is the first impression - the first thing I noticed as it was loading was a fuzzy OOF dog.  That''s because I had to scroll down to see the bottom third of the image. After seeing the whole pic I understand...I''m just saying what popped into my mind at first.  I think something that could have helped sell this is some dog tracks in the sand, especially in the vicinity where the focus is sharp (bottom third of image).  As it is, the strongest part of this image (the sand) doesn''t hold the viewers interest for long.  Creative ideas like this will work for you in the future...maybe it will this time and I''m just being too picky.  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-28 16:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1745989, 236129, 15982, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! couldn''t have asked for a better pose!</td>', 'LOL!!! couldn''t have asked for a better pose!', '2005-09-28 16:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
