(1746046, 237114, 37893, '<td valign="top">A bit out of the box but I like your attempt. The reflections are a good way to show a different POV. The only thing that bothers me a bit are the feet that are cut off.</td>', 'A bit out of the box but I like your attempt. The reflections are a good way to show a different POV. The only thing that bothers me a bit are the feet that are cut off.', '2005-09-28 17:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746047, 237312, 37893, '<td valign="top">Goodman? Amazing capture. Love the feel of this image. Right on the topic and meets challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Goodman? Amazing capture. Love the feel of this image. Right on the topic and meets challenge perfectly.', '2005-09-28 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746058, 236008, 35804, '<td valign="top">What beautiful light! And those gothic arches...the way they echo...so intriguing...I love the way they frame the couple having their nice little romantic picnic...so pretty...an image that tells a story if we let it.</td>', 'What beautiful light! And those gothic arches...the way they echo...so intriguing...I love the way they frame the couple having their nice little romantic picnic...so pretty...an image that tells a story if we let it.', '2005-09-28 17:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746063, 236199, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures in this image...the B &amp; W was also a great choice...well done.</td>', 'I really like the textures in this image...the B & W was also a great choice...well done.', '2005-09-28 17:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746070, 236147, 35804, '<td valign="top">Funny...in a twisted strange kinda way...love the title...actually one of the more interesting images in the challenge...I like this alot.</td>', 'Funny...in a twisted strange kinda way...love the title...actually one of the more interesting images in the challenge...I like this alot.', '2005-09-28 17:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1746084, 236736, 15982, '<td valign="top">YES! i bet very few know what that is - i''ll be bias and score higher just because it is the first disc golf realted picture i''ve seen here ;)</td>', 'YES! i bet very few know what that is - i''ll be bias and score higher just because it is the first disc golf realted picture i''ve seen here ;)', '2005-09-28 17:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
