(1747389, 237312, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic quality.  The black and white works well here. Good stop action as well. My only complaint is that the subject is almost entirely in shadow. ;~(</td>', 'Nice graphic quality.  The black and white works well here. Good stop action as well. My only complaint is that the subject is almost entirely in shadow. ;~(', '2005-09-29 02:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747390, 236005, 15711, '<td valign="top">This almost resembles a snowflake! The single touch of blue at the bottom is an interesting touch. I like that it isn''t symmetrical in the shot.</td>', 'This almost resembles a snowflake! The single touch of blue at the bottom is an interesting touch. I like that it isn''t symmetrical in the shot.', '2005-09-29 02:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747391, 237148, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and it certainly suits the challenge. Not crazy about the purple sky. I''d rather it be gray and not a single saturation of color.  OR I''d like to see the whole thing in color with a beautiful blue sky Nice angle to the shot. Good detail considering the distance from the stone blocks of the building.</td>', 'I like the perspective and it certainly suits the challenge. Not crazy about the purple sky. I''d rather it be gray and not a single saturation of color.  OR I''d like to see the whole thing in color with a beautiful blue sky Nice angle to the shot. Good detail considering the distance from the stone blocks of the building.', '2005-09-29 02:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747393, 237300, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that you are shooting up under the goose, which suits the challenge.  I do think it''s cropped a bit tightly. I''d like to see more negative space and the bird not so centered in the shot.</td>', 'I like that you are shooting up under the goose, which suits the challenge.  I do think it''s cropped a bit tightly. I''d like to see more negative space and the bird not so centered in the shot.', '2005-09-29 02:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747396, 235438, 15711, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of those spin art things you did as a kid with the twirling centrifuge forcing the paint to spatter out in a similar pattern.  It has a psychadelic feel, without the funky colors.  I think it''s very interesting.</td>', 'Reminds me of those spin art things you did as a kid with the twirling centrifuge forcing the paint to spatter out in a similar pattern.  It has a psychadelic feel, without the funky colors.  I think it''s very interesting.', '2005-09-29 02:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747399, 236465, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is striking with nice contrast. I wish we could see more of the columns and sense the ground a bit more.</td>', 'This is striking with nice contrast. I wish we could see more of the columns and sense the ground a bit more.', '2005-09-29 02:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747404, 234972, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this several times without commenting.  I like his folded hands and look of consternation. His face is in shadow, which is to be expected as you are under him looking up.  I like it probably more than I should and I don''t know why. It almost makes me think he has control and maybe he is sinister and you are the victim below. NOt having the circle perfectly centered adds to the interest of the shot.  I think I watch way too many crime scene tv shows. LOL  Good one. 8</td>', 'I''ve looked at this several times without commenting.  I like his folded hands and look of consternation. His face is in shadow, which is to be expected as you are under him looking up.  I like it probably more than I should and I don''t know why. It almost makes me think he has control and maybe he is sinister and you are the victim below. NOt having the circle perfectly centered adds to the interest of the shot.  I think I watch way too many crime scene tv shows. LOL  Good one. 8', '2005-09-29 02:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747406, 237012, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great rule of thirds. I like his streamline bill - you have to look at it to figure out where his head is. Nice sky too.  I give this an 8.</td>', 'Great rule of thirds. I like his streamline bill - you have to look at it to figure out where his head is. Nice sky too.  I give this an 8.', '2005-09-29 02:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747410, 236188, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a great fun sense to it. I feel like it is a tad washed out, but for some reason, it doesn''t bother me here.  It''s a bright day and that kid is out in it having fun on I assume a trampoline. Great expression. LOL  He''ll look back at this when he''s 30 and chuckle.  The symmetry is almost necessar to create this image. The focus is amazingly clear, considering the circumstance.  I''d have ore negative space above his head but that''s my only real critique.</td>', 'This has a great fun sense to it. I feel like it is a tad washed out, but for some reason, it doesn''t bother me here.  It''s a bright day and that kid is out in it having fun on I assume a trampoline. Great expression. LOL  He''ll look back at this when he''s 30 and chuckle.  The symmetry is almost necessar to create this image. The focus is amazingly clear, considering the circumstance.  I''d have ore negative space above his head but that''s my only real critique.', '2005-09-29 02:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1747466, 236746, 31637, '<td valign="top">awesome color contrast</td>', 'awesome color contrast', '2005-09-29 03:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
