(1748294, 235800, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice vision for this challenge.  I like the blue sky backdrop.  The image would have been more powerful for me if the guitar case was not there.  But I don''t know if you had any control over this.</td>', 'Nice vision for this challenge.  I like the blue sky backdrop.  The image would have been more powerful for me if the guitar case was not there.  But I don''t know if you had any control over this.', '2005-09-29 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748299, 236465, 43115, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well.  Good use of black and white, something that is generally overused here, but it adds to the feeling of age of this photo.  The exposure and DOF are good too.<br/>However, the composition seems a little off for me... It looks like a cave wall or something at the top of the photo''s foreground.  It leaves me asking "what is that".</td>', 'Meets the challenge well.  Good use of black and white, something that is generally overused here, but it adds to the feeling of age of this photo.  The exposure and DOF are good too.However, the composition seems a little off for me... It looks like a cave wall or something at the top of the photo''s foreground.  It leaves me asking "what is that".', '2005-09-29 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748300, 236101, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice beneath the building view.  The colors are so muted and muddy that I might prefer black and white.  And possibly adding some contrast would add a little depth.  Very interesting architecture and nice subject for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice beneath the building view.  The colors are so muted and muddy that I might prefer black and white.  And possibly adding some contrast would add a little depth.  Very interesting architecture and nice subject for this challenge.', '2005-09-29 14:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748305, 237151, 12223, '<td valign="top">Pretty good job framing the top line.  Only a small corner in the upper right is off.  Good dof.  Solid architectural shot.</td>', 'Pretty good job framing the top line.  Only a small corner in the upper right is off.  Good dof.  Solid architectural shot.', '2005-09-29 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748311, 237124, 12223, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and strong framing of subject.</td>', 'Good clarity and strong framing of subject.', '2005-09-29 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748312, 237360, 12223, '<td valign="top">I just plain like it.</td>', 'I just plain like it.', '2005-09-29 14:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748316, 235655, 43115, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The color is really good here.  The lighting is perfectly done to get that "glow" through the edges.  However, I wish the DOF had been tweaked to get the whole thing in focus.  At least for me, in abstract shots like this where my eye is wandering all over the place, I want the whole thing to be in focus.  To me, this just isn''t as sharp as it could be.  Nice job, though.</td>', 'Wow.  The color is really good here.  The lighting is perfectly done to get that "glow" through the edges.  However, I wish the DOF had been tweaked to get the whole thing in focus.  At least for me, in abstract shots like this where my eye is wandering all over the place, I want the whole thing to be in focus.  To me, this just isn''t as sharp as it could be.  Nice job, though.', '2005-09-29 14:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
