(1748388, 237275, 42005, '<td valign="top">The shells remind me of my favorite spot in the USA and I wish I were there right now.  Love th focus on the shell on the right and the view of the water.  So nice.</td>', 'The shells remind me of my favorite spot in the USA and I wish I were there right now.  Love th focus on the shell on the right and the view of the water.  So nice.', '2005-09-29 14:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748392, 236200, 42005, '<td valign="top">I  wish he were painted on my foyer wall. He is priceless!</td>', 'I  wish he were painted on my foyer wall. He is priceless!', '2005-09-29 14:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748394, 237170, 9478, '<td valign="top">Nice cat; it is really looking at you. Perhaps there is too much picture out of focus.</td>', 'Nice cat; it is really looking at you. Perhaps there is too much picture out of focus.', '2005-09-29 14:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748397, 237398, 12223, '<td valign="top">Captivating colors.</td>', 'Captivating colors.', '2005-09-29 14:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748401, 236030, 42005, '<td valign="top">I can not put into words how nice this is.  Very sharp and it is so pleasing!</td>', 'I can not put into words how nice this is.  Very sharp and it is so pleasing!', '2005-09-29 14:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748402, 237209, 42005, '<td valign="top">This makes me so very homesick.  Love it!</td>', 'This makes me so very homesick.  Love it!', '2005-09-29 14:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748405, 237312, 12223, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  Well done.', '2005-09-29 14:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748415, 235594, 33068, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors.', '2005-09-29 14:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748418, 237360, 33068, '<td valign="top">Cool POV.</td>', 'Cool POV.', '2005-09-29 14:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748420, 237386, 31443, '<td valign="top">Obviously! Fun photo, like it lots..</td>', 'Obviously! Fun photo, like it lots..', '2005-09-29 14:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748422, 237310, 33068, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and composition.  My only issue is with the hair in the face.</td>', 'Nice tones and composition.  My only issue is with the hair in the face.', '2005-09-29 14:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748423, 237091, 9478, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective!</td>', 'Fantastic perspective!', '2005-09-29 15:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748424, 236200, 12223, '<td valign="top">;-}</td>', ';-}', '2005-09-29 15:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748426, 235426, 33068, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot.  Maybe spending a little more time on composition and washing the car would have helped.  Keep shooting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 10:52:00.</i></td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot.  Maybe spending a little more time on composition and washing the car would have helped.  Keep shooting.', '2005-09-29 15:01:38.000000', '2005-10-05 11:52:00.000000', 1),
(1748432, 236258, 9478, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a bit dark and the sky is too noisy. I don''t like it very much.</td>', 'I think it''s a bit dark and the sky is too noisy. I don''t like it very much.', '2005-09-29 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748434, 237128, 9478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but does it fit in the challenge?</td>', 'Nice shot but does it fit in the challenge?', '2005-09-29 15:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748436, 237188, 9478, '<td valign="top">Simple, colorfull, nice background and contrast.</td>', 'Simple, colorfull, nice background and contrast.', '2005-09-29 15:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748482, 237368, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wish you had skipped the person bending down over the flower...also could be a lot sharper.</td>', 'Wish you had skipped the person bending down over the flower...also could be a lot sharper.', '2005-09-29 15:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748484, 236158, 31443, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors here and contrast..</td>', 'Lovely colors here and contrast..', '2005-09-29 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748492, 235359, 12223, '<td valign="top">Very slick photograph.  Most interested in reading how this was done while maintaining the clarity. Appears as an add glossy to me.  Would make an excellant example of a print for Mettalic paper.</td>', 'Very slick photograph.  Most interested in reading how this was done while maintaining the clarity. Appears as an add glossy to me.  Would make an excellant example of a print for Mettalic paper.', '2005-09-29 15:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748493, 236188, 31443, '<td valign="top">Genuine thrill! Love this face :)</td>', 'Genuine thrill! Love this face :)', '2005-09-29 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748498, 237078, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice long vertical shot. Good sky, nice reflections.</td>', 'Nice long vertical shot. Good sky, nice reflections.', '2005-09-29 15:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748500, 237217, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I find the large object on the left side distracting and the angle makes me feel like I''m about to topple over. I keep turning my head to the right so I can see this with the tree and sky in a more "normal" position.</td>', 'For me, I find the large object on the left side distracting and the angle makes me feel like I''m about to topple over. I keep turning my head to the right so I can see this with the tree and sky in a more "normal" position.', '2005-09-29 15:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748504, 236477, 41675, '<td valign="top">Different interpretation for the challenge - not bad. Good sunlight...toes look well taken care of - no fungus or anything :-)</td>', 'Different interpretation for the challenge - not bad. Good sunlight...toes look well taken care of - no fungus or anything :-)', '2005-09-29 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748507, 235243, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was to follow her eyes, but that leads me right out of the photo. It''s too bad she wasn''t looking into the camera. For me, it would be even better if that distracting tree wasn''t in the lower right (hard to help sometimes, I know) I do like her expression - looks like she''s having fun.</td>', 'My first reaction was to follow her eyes, but that leads me right out of the photo. It''s too bad she wasn''t looking into the camera. For me, it would be even better if that distracting tree wasn''t in the lower right (hard to help sometimes, I know) I do like her expression - looks like she''s having fun.', '2005-09-29 15:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748508, 237012, 41675, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet has an elegance for me. I love the contrast of the bird itself to the sky - very nice. Good luck in the chalenge. 8</td>', 'Simple, yet has an elegance for me. I love the contrast of the bird itself to the sky - very nice. Good luck in the chalenge. 8', '2005-09-29 15:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748510, 235951, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice gold statue. I wonder how this would look if not so...centered in the photo. For me, having the main subject slightly off center adds more interest.</td>', 'Nice gold statue. I wonder how this would look if not so...centered in the photo. For me, having the main subject slightly off center adds more interest.', '2005-09-29 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748512, 236188, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL! What a fun and terific photo. I love the expression on his face - pricelss. Good colors, crisp and clean! 10 (and good luck - hope you get a ribbon)</td>', 'LOL! What a fun and terific photo. I love the expression on his face - pricelss. Good colors, crisp and clean! 10 (and good luck - hope you get a ribbon)', '2005-09-29 15:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748513, 235231, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first thought was that he was going to bang his head on that light - even though I know it''s taller than he is, but visually looks like he''s going to hit it. Rather than being afraid - his expression makes me snicker. He has too much of a "sweet face"</td>', 'My first thought was that he was going to bang his head on that light - even though I know it''s taller than he is, but visually looks like he''s going to hit it. Rather than being afraid - his expression makes me snicker. He has too much of a "sweet face"', '2005-09-29 15:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748514, 235008, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like how the red grids draw my eyes upward, but then they just stop dead at the black rectangle towards the top.</td>', 'I like how the red grids draw my eyes upward, but then they just stop dead at the black rectangle towards the top.', '2005-09-29 15:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748515, 237335, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think you had a good concept here with the naturally framed "Window" to the sky.  I''m not comfortable with the post-processing applied and the hue color shift.  It''s interesting, but to me not an overwhelming "cool - way to go" kind of thing.  Others may like it...   Looks like you had a nice natural sky with good cloud formations to work with - could have looked nice left natural.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think you had a good concept here with the naturally framed "Window" to the sky.  I''m not comfortable with the post-processing applied and the hue color shift.  It''s interesting, but to me not an overwhelming "cool - way to go" kind of thing.  Others may like it...   Looks like you had a nice natural sky with good cloud formations to work with - could have looked nice left natural.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-29 15:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748518, 237221, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a bit too dark and perhaps a bit of contrast would help around her legs and the tree branch. Also, the very thick black border on the bottom is a bit much. I prefer subltety in borders. I do like the angle and subject matter though.</td>', 'For me, this is a bit too dark and perhaps a bit of contrast would help around her legs and the tree branch. Also, the very thick black border on the bottom is a bit much. I prefer subltety in borders. I do like the angle and subject matter though.', '2005-09-29 15:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748519, 236125, 41675, '<td valign="top">The building is good and the angle, but the sky seems a bit over saturated on the right hand side to me, too bright and a bit on the yellowish side.</td>', 'The building is good and the angle, but the sky seems a bit over saturated on the right hand side to me, too bright and a bit on the yellowish side.', '2005-09-29 15:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748520, 236597, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice refreshing angle for one of those "monsters." I like the solid sky blue as well. Good solid entry.</td>', 'Nice refreshing angle for one of those "monsters." I like the solid sky blue as well. Good solid entry.', '2005-09-29 15:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748531, 235305, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a creative take on the challenge theme - one that comes naturally to mind, and you certainly can''t be accused of not meeting the challenge.  ;^)  In general I like the composition.  The first diagonal (from bottom left) leaf is distracting.  I get the impression that including the sun was intentional in your composition.  It''s a good idea - but this lighting is challenging and personally I think it''s overexposed.  A faster shutter speed, tighter aperture, or some filters could have helped tone it down a bit.  If your camera has exposure compensation that could have been considered by setting it to say -2.0.  One last consideration, did you think about exposing to create a silhouette?  With the plant patterns it might have been rather unique (minus that diagonal leaf of course - &lt;grin&gt;).   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a creative take on the challenge theme - one that comes naturally to mind, and you certainly can''t be accused of not meeting the challenge.  ;^)  In general I like the composition.  The first diagonal (from bottom left) leaf is distracting.  I get the impression that including the sun was intentional in your composition.  It''s a good idea - but this lighting is challenging and personally I think it''s overexposed.  A faster shutter speed, tighter aperture, or some filters could have helped tone it down a bit.  If your camera has exposure compensation that could have been considered by setting it to say -2.0.  One last consideration, did you think about exposing to create a silhouette?  With the plant patterns it might have been rather unique (minus that diagonal leaf of course - <grin>).   Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-09-29 15:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748544, 236008, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like the image a lot but aren''t we looking a little down here?</td>', 'I like the image a lot but aren''t we looking a little down here?', '2005-09-29 15:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748583, 235316, 10263, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous building. Too bad you couldn''t have cropped that dark object off on the top left, but I see why you couldn''t. Nice colors and perspective.</td>', 'Gorgeous building. Too bad you couldn''t have cropped that dark object off on the top left, but I see why you couldn''t. Nice colors and perspective.', '2005-09-29 16:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748650, 235435, 39278, '<td valign="top">frooooooooooooooogs! beautiful</td>', 'frooooooooooooooogs! beautiful', '2005-09-29 17:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748667, 235304, 39278, '<td valign="top">waw cool...whats the story of this photo?</td>', 'waw cool...whats the story of this photo?', '2005-09-29 17:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748673, 236979, 42139, '<td valign="top">I think this picture could have been made better if you had taken it with a different perspective, maybe if you had gotten under and taken a shot form the flyers point of view... from the hand, to the line... to the kite.</td>', 'I think this picture could have been made better if you had taken it with a different perspective, maybe if you had gotten under and taken a shot form the flyers point of view... from the hand, to the line... to the kite.', '2005-09-29 17:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748676, 236092, 42139, '<td valign="top">I really like the amount of detail in this shot, and the way you''ve cropped some of the bike out... Nice comp.</td>', 'I really like the amount of detail in this shot, and the way you''ve cropped some of the bike out... Nice comp.', '2005-09-29 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748677, 237114, 42139, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections to capture the sky.</td>', 'Nice use of reflections to capture the sky.', '2005-09-29 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748680, 236937, 42139, '<td valign="top">This picture would look a little better if you had balanced it symetricaly a little more, just from looking at it you know that from that point of view it would have been balanced on either side... so it''s distracting to see it not.</td>', 'This picture would look a little better if you had balanced it symetricaly a little more, just from looking at it you know that from that point of view it would have been balanced on either side... so it''s distracting to see it not.', '2005-09-29 17:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748682, 235772, 42139, '<td valign="top">Nice comp... and I love the contrast from one side to the other.</td>', 'Nice comp... and I love the contrast from one side to the other.', '2005-09-29 17:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748683, 235231, 42139, '<td valign="top">If you lost the lamp post I think this picture would have worked....</td>', 'If you lost the lamp post I think this picture would have worked....', '2005-09-29 17:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748688, 236420, 42139, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand... isn''t this picture from a birds eye view???</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand... isn''t this picture from a birds eye view???', '2005-09-29 17:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748689, 237004, 42139, '<td valign="top">Nice framing... directs the eye just where you want to go, although it''s not an overly exciting picture... but your idea is good.</td>', 'Nice framing... directs the eye just where you want to go, although it''s not an overly exciting picture... but your idea is good.', '2005-09-29 17:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748691, 237375, 42139, '<td valign="top">The fish eye really works with this shot, because  althought he sides are a fleshed out... all the lines are directed upwards... and because of the roundness of the sides you are kind of forced to look up... too bad there weren''t some clouds in the sky to look at.</td>', 'The fish eye really works with this shot, because  althought he sides are a fleshed out... all the lines are directed upwards... and because of the roundness of the sides you are kind of forced to look up... too bad there weren''t some clouds in the sky to look at.', '2005-09-29 17:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748694, 237139, 42139, '<td valign="top">THe leaves to the left of the picture are distracting, other then that you''ve got the idea down.</td>', 'THe leaves to the left of the picture are distracting, other then that you''ve got the idea down.', '2005-09-29 17:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748697, 237126, 42139, '<td valign="top">The flash is too bright, and the one shadow is way to distracting... I''m not a fan of flash photography is maybe that''s just me.</td>', 'The flash is too bright, and the one shadow is way to distracting... I''m not a fan of flash photography is maybe that''s just me.', '2005-09-29 17:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748700, 235479, 42139, '<td valign="top">I love how simple this picture is... and the sky is stunning.... Shame you don''t have the girl leaning over the edge looking out.</td>', 'I love how simple this picture is... and the sky is stunning.... Shame you don''t have the girl leaning over the edge looking out.', '2005-09-29 17:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748701, 236223, 42139, '<td valign="top">This picture would be stunning if it didn''t have that tree it in, shame that you can''t move nature eh... I really like the perspective.</td>', 'This picture would be stunning if it didn''t have that tree it in, shame that you can''t move nature eh... I really like the perspective.', '2005-09-29 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748702, 236456, 39821, '<td valign="top">Simply nice!  Makes ya wonder what''s over the hill.</td>', 'Simply nice!  Makes ya wonder what''s over the hill.', '2005-09-29 17:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748704, 237013, 42139, '<td valign="top">Wow... is this the raw picture, or have you used lighting and everything on this.</td>', 'Wow... is this the raw picture, or have you used lighting and everything on this.', '2005-09-29 17:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748705, 234740, 42139, '<td valign="top">At frst I thought that the floors were distracting, but they are kind of nice.... although the dead ones distract from the feeling of the picture.</td>', 'At frst I thought that the floors were distracting, but they are kind of nice.... although the dead ones distract from the feeling of the picture.', '2005-09-29 17:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748708, 235438, 42139, '<td valign="top">Nice use of zoom blur here.</td>', 'Nice use of zoom blur here.', '2005-09-29 17:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748710, 235359, 42139, '<td valign="top">HOW did you get this picture....</td>', 'HOW did you get this picture....', '2005-09-29 17:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748711, 235917, 43565, '<td valign="top"></td>', '', '2005-09-29 17:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748713, 235660, 42139, '<td valign="top">Did anyone else think that trees were going to be over done?<br/>THe minute I read the theme, I knew that I was going to go through I list of trees three miles long.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry, it doesn''t seem like you''ve put much thought into this picture. <br/> <br/>I think you could have maybe found a forest, and got some shiloutes of leaves if you wanted to do the tree approach.<br/> <br/>Just my two cents.</td>', 'Did anyone else think that trees were going to be over done?THe minute I read the theme, I knew that I was going to go through I list of trees three miles long. I''m sorry, it doesn''t seem like you''ve put much thought into this picture.  I think you could have maybe found a forest, and got some shiloutes of leaves if you wanted to do the tree approach. Just my two cents.', '2005-09-29 17:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748718, 235002, 42139, '<td valign="top">I love how blured out the background is, and I''m really loving the colour of this... the morning glory stands out from the darkness of the backtground, and the water droplets look almost fake.<br/> <br/>Great job, good luck :)</td>', 'I love how blured out the background is, and I''m really loving the colour of this... the morning glory stands out from the darkness of the backtground, and the water droplets look almost fake. Great job, good luck :)', '2005-09-29 17:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1748720, 235909, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is on the ground, but does not look to me like from the ground up.</td>', 'This is on the ground, but does not look to me like from the ground up.', '2005-09-29 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
