(1749100, 237137, 41675, '<td valign="top">This is kind of the opposite type of shot from how I interpreted the challenge. To me this is more like the view from above looking down. I wonder how this would look at a different time of the day with maybe the sun illuminating down into the valley itself? I''d like to see a bit stronger saturation of color as it looks like a beautiful spot.</td>', 'This is kind of the opposite type of shot from how I interpreted the challenge. To me this is more like the view from above looking down. I wonder how this would look at a different time of the day with maybe the sun illuminating down into the valley itself? I''d like to see a bit stronger saturation of color as it looks like a beautiful spot.', '2005-09-29 20:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1749102, 236605, 41675, '<td valign="top">Certainly not as dramatic as other ground up entries I''ve seen, but I like the black and white and wonderful lighting. Overall, a nice, pleasing photo in my opinion.</td>', 'Certainly not as dramatic as other ground up entries I''ve seen, but I like the black and white and wonderful lighting. Overall, a nice, pleasing photo in my opinion.', '2005-09-29 20:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
