(1749302, 237354, 41675, '<td valign="top">The lower left corner area appears yellowish and grainy which I find detracts from the overall quality of the photo. Interesting choice for the shot, using the words. I like that part.</td>', 'The lower left corner area appears yellowish and grainy which I find detracts from the overall quality of the photo. Interesting choice for the shot, using the words. I like that part.', '2005-09-29 22:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
