(1749584, 236059, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice farm view. Great colors and I like the low angle. I''ve always liked the rolled haybales too. Too bad about those darn telephone polls, but you have no control over them.</td>', 'Very nice farm view. Great colors and I like the low angle. I''ve always liked the rolled haybales too. Too bad about those darn telephone polls, but you have no control over them.', '2005-09-30 00:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
