(1751228, 237308, 30881, '<td valign="top">This would have been much better if you focused strictly on the pine cone without the blurred cyclist or strictly the cyclist without the in focus pinecone but not both. You actually have a pine cone a cyclist and a brown blurry leaf all fighting for the viewers attention. Try picking one subject and then make it get the viewers total attention. Keep at it and please don''t get discouraged.</td>', 'This would have been much better if you focused strictly on the pine cone without the blurred cyclist or strictly the cyclist without the in focus pinecone but not both. You actually have a pine cone a cyclist and a brown blurry leaf all fighting for the viewers attention. Try picking one subject and then make it get the viewers total attention. Keep at it and please don''t get discouraged.', '2005-09-30 20:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1751232, 236795, 30881, '<td valign="top">A nice clean building image, would have preferred seeing it from a bit of a different angle without the tower in the background. It would have been much more dynamic</td>', 'A nice clean building image, would have preferred seeing it from a bit of a different angle without the tower in the background. It would have been much more dynamic', '2005-09-30 21:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
