(1751547, 235594, 41574, '<td valign="top">So many flower shots. Everyone seems to love the "ground-up" theme from a bug''s perspective...or, they''re just fond of their macro work, and are making up excuses for why it should be here. I love the picture, but I don''t see its connection to the theme. Shot: "10"; pertinence to topic: "2." I''ll give you a "6."</td>', 'So many flower shots. Everyone seems to love the "ground-up" theme from a bug''s perspective...or, they''re just fond of their macro work, and are making up excuses for why it should be here. I love the picture, but I don''t see its connection to the theme. Shot: "10"; pertinence to topic: "2." I''ll give you a "6."', '2005-10-01 00:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
