(1751555, 237143, 41574, '<td valign="top">One of the more ingenious shots that have been submitted. Technically, too, quite sound. Few underwater photographs, it seems, turn out this good. Great work!</td>', 'One of the more ingenious shots that have been submitted. Technically, too, quite sound. Few underwater photographs, it seems, turn out this good. Great work!', '2005-10-01 00:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
