(1751658, 237160, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice different angle of a lighthouse. I like the red, white and blue colors. The subject isn''t as "exciting" for me as other entries in the challnege, but a good solid photo.</td>', 'Nice different angle of a lighthouse. I like the red, white and blue colors. The subject isn''t as "exciting" for me as other entries in the challnege, but a good solid photo.', '2005-10-01 01:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
