(1752857, 235737, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well played out photo. The flash is a bit too brightfor me,  but the concept came out well. Vey cleverly done.</td>', 'Well played out photo. The flash is a bit too brightfor me,  but the concept came out well. Vey cleverly done.', '2005-10-01 20:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752859, 237350, 41675, '<td valign="top">One of the few pictures I''ve seen of a chain link and it looks somewhat interesting. The highlights on the chain are a little too bright or washed out for me.  I don''t necessariy get a "from the ground up" feeling because it''s such a tight macro, but I like the color treatment.</td>', 'One of the few pictures I''ve seen of a chain link and it looks somewhat interesting. The highlights on the chain are a little too bright or washed out for me.  I don''t necessariy get a "from the ground up" feeling because it''s such a tight macro, but I like the color treatment.', '2005-10-01 20:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752860, 237324, 41675, '<td valign="top">This photo could use a little more focus for me. I like the concept and idea though. It makes me feel as if I''m on his feet.</td>', 'This photo could use a little more focus for me. I like the concept and idea though. It makes me feel as if I''m on his feet.', '2005-10-01 20:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752862, 235059, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite see the realtion of your title to the photo, but frankly, titles don''t count one way or the other for me - it''s the photo itself. I like the silhouetted birds. The wire lines...I''m not sure if they distract or add the needed balance to keep this from being an average photo. I''ll come back for a second look.</td>', 'I don''t quite see the realtion of your title to the photo, but frankly, titles don''t count one way or the other for me - it''s the photo itself. I like the silhouetted birds. The wire lines...I''m not sure if they distract or add the needed balance to keep this from being an average photo. I''ll come back for a second look.', '2005-10-01 20:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752864, 236656, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.yum! Now that is one very tasty looking apple Good colors and closeup.</td>', 'Hmmm.yum! Now that is one very tasty looking apple Good colors and closeup.', '2005-10-01 20:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752866, 236465, 41675, '<td valign="top">The lack of sky seems very...odd to me, like it''s been washed out (and you may have chosen to do this on purpose - I don''t know) :-) My favorite part is how you used part of the structure as a frame at the top of the photo.</td>', 'The lack of sky seems very...odd to me, like it''s been washed out (and you may have chosen to do this on purpose - I don''t know) :-) My favorite part is how you used part of the structure as a frame at the top of the photo.', '2005-10-01 20:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752869, 237254, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the overwhelming white areas in the sky are distracting. I like the small in focus area of the new leaf growth.</td>', 'For me, the overwhelming white areas in the sky are distracting. I like the small in focus area of the new leaf growth.', '2005-10-01 20:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752871, 237308, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I look at your photo, my eyes stay focused on the pince cones and I have to "force" my eyes to move about the rest of your photo. Also, I find that if the main focused subject area is off-centered it can draw the viewer deeper into the picture itself.</td>', 'When I look at your photo, my eyes stay focused on the pince cones and I have to "force" my eyes to move about the rest of your photo. Also, I find that if the main focused subject area is off-centered it can draw the viewer deeper into the picture itself.', '2005-10-01 20:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752873, 236750, 41675, '<td valign="top">How like the angle and the colors of the arches. The overcast sky gives me a sense that summer is indeed over and fall aproaches.</td>', 'How like the angle and the colors of the arches. The overcast sky gives me a sense that summer is indeed over and fall aproaches.', '2005-10-01 20:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752876, 236502, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I find that when the main subject is off centered there is more interest. It can lead the viewer''s eyes into and up in a photo. When subjects are smack dab in the middle, my eyes don''t tend to look anywhere else.</td>', 'For me, I find that when the main subject is off centered there is more interest. It can lead the viewer''s eyes into and up in a photo. When subjects are smack dab in the middle, my eyes don''t tend to look anywhere else.', '2005-10-01 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752878, 235433, 35297, '<td valign="top">Wife voted</td>', 'Wife voted', '2005-10-01 20:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752883, 237189, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the tree trunks and the low angle is nice. The one thing that distracts me is the branch in the upper right. it appears to be floating to me since there isn''t any kind of connecting branch or trunk to be seen.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the tree trunks and the low angle is nice. The one thing that distracts me is the branch in the upper right. it appears to be floating to me since there isn''t any kind of connecting branch or trunk to be seen.', '2005-10-01 20:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752885, 237382, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as other entries in the challenge. I wonder what an even lower or steeper angle would look like? The area around the label text looks a bit pixelated on my screen, but I like the lighiting.</td>', 'For me, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as other entries in the challenge. I wonder what an even lower or steeper angle would look like? The area around the label text looks a bit pixelated on my screen, but I like the lighiting.', '2005-10-01 20:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752888, 236968, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice and powerful shot. Great sky and the silhoutted rider looks terrific. Being nit picky - I would say to clone out that one "stick" near the tire on the lower left side. Otherwise, well done and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice and powerful shot. Great sky and the silhoutted rider looks terrific. Being nit picky - I would say to clone out that one "stick" near the tire on the lower left side. Otherwise, well done and good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-01 20:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752889, 235833, 41675, '<td valign="top">What an interesting tree. The colors are maybe just a tad too dark for me, and it seems a bit out of focus (then again, could be my glasses need cleaning) :-)</td>', 'What an interesting tree. The colors are maybe just a tad too dark for me, and it seems a bit out of focus (then again, could be my glasses need cleaning) :-)', '2005-10-01 20:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752891, 235135, 41675, '<td valign="top">If someone were to show me this photo and ask me to guess the topic, it would take a while for me to say "from the ground up". I like the composition and the colors are good, but for me it doesn''t fit the challenge as well as other entries.</td>', 'If someone were to show me this photo and ask me to guess the topic, it would take a while for me to say "from the ground up". I like the composition and the colors are good, but for me it doesn''t fit the challenge as well as other entries.', '2005-10-01 20:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752892, 235909, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL - after looking at what seems like 10 tree shots in a row I laughed out loud with yours. Thank you for the change of pace, and the smile. Very funny.</td>', 'LOL - after looking at what seems like 10 tree shots in a row I laughed out loud with yours. Thank you for the change of pace, and the smile. Very funny.', '2005-10-01 20:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752893, 235452, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but for me I wish there was another object or two to add overall interest to the subject.</td>', 'I like the concept, but for me I wish there was another object or two to add overall interest to the subject.', '2005-10-01 20:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752894, 237321, 41675, '<td valign="top">Something different - I like that aspect. I like the wall color too</td>', 'Something different - I like that aspect. I like the wall color too', '2005-10-01 20:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752895, 237380, 35297, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the Princes'' Gates</td>', 'Good shot of the Princes'' Gates', '2005-10-01 20:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752896, 237195, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Too bad some of her hair wasn''t "falling" down towards the rail to increase the effect. Her skin tones look a bit reddish and her forehead a bit bright, but again - shows imagination.</td>', 'Good idea. Too bad some of her hair wasn''t "falling" down towards the rail to increase the effect. Her skin tones look a bit reddish and her forehead a bit bright, but again - shows imagination.', '2005-10-01 20:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752897, 235849, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice, pretty shot. Good colors.</td>', 'Nice, pretty shot. Good colors.', '2005-10-01 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752898, 235215, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, what a sad looking pup! I like the colors and his eyes make me look up. I also like the white background against the dog - good contrast.</td>', 'Awww, what a sad looking pup! I like the colors and his eyes make me look up. I also like the white background against the dog - good contrast.', '2005-10-01 20:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752899, 237115, 41675, '<td valign="top">It''s a magnificent building to be sure. My eyes start at the top and follow the arches down to the bottom. It''s a bit on the dark side. I''d like to see it with a bit more saturation - but not too much.</td>', 'It''s a magnificent building to be sure. My eyes start at the top and follow the arches down to the bottom. It''s a bit on the dark side. I''d like to see it with a bit more saturation - but not too much.', '2005-10-01 20:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752906, 236797, 10047, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overprocessed or washed out. I might have cropped as a portrait and just focused on the main building and entrance way.</td>', 'Seems a bit overprocessed or washed out. I might have cropped as a portrait and just focused on the main building and entrance way.', '2005-10-01 21:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752907, 236972, 44741, '<td valign="top">You got  a smudge on your lens there. A little bit of stamping in Photoshop wouldn''t have hurt.</td>', 'You got  a smudge on your lens there. A little bit of stamping in Photoshop wouldn''t have hurt.', '2005-10-01 21:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752912, 237368, 10047, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overprocessed and the person is a distracting.</td>', 'Seems a bit overprocessed and the person is a distracting.', '2005-10-01 21:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752914, 235215, 44741, '<td valign="top">Good thing dogs can''t fly. I already have difficulty holding them on the ground, imagine if they could fly off of it!! Cute pic!</td>', 'Good thing dogs can''t fly. I already have difficulty holding them on the ground, imagine if they could fly off of it!! Cute pic!', '2005-10-01 21:11:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1752917, 236750, 10047, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see it cropped with just the red, yellow, and green pipes going into the sky (no ground or horizon).</td>', 'I''d like to see it cropped with just the red, yellow, and green pipes going into the sky (no ground or horizon).', '2005-10-01 21:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752923, 235915, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried stepping away half a foot at a time, and compared the impact of each angle. Might have tried it with a portrait orientation also.</td>', 'I might have tried stepping away half a foot at a time, and compared the impact of each angle. Might have tried it with a portrait orientation also.', '2005-10-01 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752924, 236735, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried moving around to the right of the tree where the light source is. I want to see more detail in the bark.</td>', 'I might have tried moving around to the right of the tree where the light source is. I want to see more detail in the bark.', '2005-10-01 21:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752927, 236563, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the idea, but the grainy and blurriness doesn''t work for my eyes. Her face seems a bit too washed out, but that might have been your intention. I really do like the concept though.</td>', 'I like the composition and the idea, but the grainy and blurriness doesn''t work for my eyes. Her face seems a bit too washed out, but that might have been your intention. I really do like the concept though.', '2005-10-01 21:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752928, 235250, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good thing you had the title as I wouldn''t have known what it was. I like the graphic shapes created by the fountain and the negative space around. Makes me thirsty...hold on...I need to get some water ;-) 7</td>', 'Good thing you had the title as I wouldn''t have known what it was. I like the graphic shapes created by the fountain and the negative space around. Makes me thirsty...hold on...I need to get some water ;-) 7', '2005-10-01 21:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752931, 235438, 41675, '<td valign="top">At first, I didn''t care for the effect, but after studying it for a moment or two it''s not too bad, I guess. The thing I don''t like is how it all points to the "dead" center of the photo. I always find photos more interesting when the main subject is off to one side or another - that can lead the viewers eye into a photo.</td>', 'At first, I didn''t care for the effect, but after studying it for a moment or two it''s not too bad, I guess. The thing I don''t like is how it all points to the "dead" center of the photo. I always find photos more interesting when the main subject is off to one side or another - that can lead the viewers eye into a photo.', '2005-10-01 21:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752933, 236420, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good concept and makes me think of a snail shell shape. It seems to need something though - the composition is stark, or maybe it''s the lighting...I''m not sure.</td>', 'Good concept and makes me think of a snail shell shape. It seems to need something though - the composition is stark, or maybe it''s the lighting...I''m not sure.', '2005-10-01 21:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752934, 234740, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and good "from the ground up" in my opinion. The sky is terrific and complementing orange flowers frame it all so well. 9</td>', 'Nice framing and good "from the ground up" in my opinion. The sky is terrific and complementing orange flowers frame it all so well. 9', '2005-10-01 21:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752937, 236483, 44172, '<td valign="top">this is lovely, don''t see ground up relation though - perhaps the little girl is running into her open arms and then lifted up from the ground?</td>', 'this is lovely, don''t see ground up relation though - perhaps the little girl is running into her open arms and then lifted up from the ground?', '2005-10-01 21:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752938, 236799, 41675, '<td valign="top">The sky and club are a bit .... pixelated on my screen, but I like your take on the challenge. I can almost hear Billy Murray in the background coming after me. LOL. (Nice ad for Nike too). 7</td>', 'The sky and club are a bit .... pixelated on my screen, but I like your take on the challenge. I can almost hear Billy Murray in the background coming after me. LOL. (Nice ad for Nike too). 7', '2005-10-01 21:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752940, 236292, 44172, '<td valign="top">well if this isn''t eye candy...what is?</td>', 'well if this isn''t eye candy...what is?', '2005-10-01 21:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752941, 236129, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had this been a vertical with more of the long neck showing I would have given it a ten. Great capture on the face though. Excellent focus and lighting. 9</td>', 'Had this been a vertical with more of the long neck showing I would have given it a ten. Great capture on the face though. Excellent focus and lighting. 9', '2005-10-01 21:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752942, 236479, 44172, '<td valign="top">They are real cute, a little grainy though and I don''t see ground up connection.</td>', 'They are real cute, a little grainy though and I don''t see ground up connection.', '2005-10-01 21:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752943, 236965, 41675, '<td valign="top">The best fair shot I''ve seen from the ones entered in this challenge. The wider angle gives more of the "from the ground up" feeling. Great sky too. 7</td>', 'The best fair shot I''ve seen from the ones entered in this challenge. The wider angle gives more of the "from the ground up" feeling. Great sky too. 7', '2005-10-01 21:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752969, 235726, 39821, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant light!</td>', 'Very pleasant light!', '2005-10-01 21:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1752970, 234878, 39821, '<td valign="top">....now, if we only had a Goldfinch...</td>', '....now, if we only had a Goldfinch...', '2005-10-01 21:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753111, 236073, 44991, '<td valign="top">4 me its better to crop off top 1/3rd</td>', '4 me its better to crop off top 1/3rd', '2005-10-01 23:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753116, 237010, 44991, '<td valign="top">try turning 90 degrees clockwise, more grab, still a bit busy though</td>', 'try turning 90 degrees clockwise, more grab, still a bit busy though', '2005-10-01 23:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753117, 235168, 44991, '<td valign="top">no subject</td>', 'no subject', '2005-10-01 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753120, 236968, 44991, '<td valign="top">not sure col is right, good catch</td>', 'not sure col is right, good catch', '2005-10-01 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753125, 236479, 44991, '<td valign="top">why so light?.<br/>v natural catch.6</td>', 'why so light?.v natural catch.6', '2005-10-01 23:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753131, 237101, 44991, '<td valign="top">made me look twice, might need a bit more contrast to emphasise the lines.7</td>', 'made me look twice, might need a bit more contrast to emphasise the lines.7', '2005-10-02 00:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753132, 236303, 44991, '<td valign="top">my fav so far 9</td>', 'my fav so far 9', '2005-10-02 00:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753136, 237407, 44991, '<td valign="top">great 9</td>', 'great 9', '2005-10-02 00:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753140, 235435, 44991, '<td valign="top">strange colour</td>', 'strange colour', '2005-10-02 00:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753141, 234735, 44991, '<td valign="top">black leaf detracts</td>', 'black leaf detracts', '2005-10-02 00:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753181, 235304, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the subject ... I guess it''s a big outdoor artwork/sculpture plus a building?  Whatever, I do love your photograph of it.  The converging verticals and the diverging wires together make a graphically powerful image that forces the viewer to engage the brain &amp; think about it.  I like that in any image!</td>', 'I don''t understand the subject ... I guess it''s a big outdoor artwork/sculpture plus a building?  Whatever, I do love your photograph of it.  The converging verticals and the diverging wires together make a graphically powerful image that forces the viewer to engage the brain & think about it.  I like that in any image!', '2005-10-02 00:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753191, 235427, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is terrific!  Arresting composition, and a great idea to juxtapose the tree with the grungy old plastic drum ... the image demands the viewer''s attention.  I like photographs that use just a few elements for maximum visual and intellectual impact, and this is one of those!</td>', 'This is terrific!  Arresting composition, and a great idea to juxtapose the tree with the grungy old plastic drum ... the image demands the viewer''s attention.  I like photographs that use just a few elements for maximum visual and intellectual impact, and this is one of those!', '2005-10-02 00:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753198, 237012, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love it.  A really terrific example of minimalism for a legitimate artistic purpose.  The bird (pelican?) from this point of view takes on a beautiful sculptural form, and your composition/crop is inspired.  It''s a very instructive example of why vision is the most important tool in the photographer''s bag.  10.</td>', 'Love it.  A really terrific example of minimalism for a legitimate artistic purpose.  The bird (pelican?) from this point of view takes on a beautiful sculptural form, and your composition/crop is inspired.  It''s a very instructive example of why vision is the most important tool in the photographer''s bag.  10.', '2005-10-02 00:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753204, 237114, 30364, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  This is a great example of the fact that there is wonderful art all around us, and nearly everyone (including me) just blunders on by and sees nothing.  An inspired idea, boldly and confidently executed.  My favourite of this challenge.  11.</td>', 'Brilliant.  This is a great example of the fact that there is wonderful art all around us, and nearly everyone (including me) just blunders on by and sees nothing.  An inspired idea, boldly and confidently executed.  My favourite of this challenge.  11.', '2005-10-02 00:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753206, 236120, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely study of shapes and tones.  Well composed for maximum impact, too.</td>', 'Lovely study of shapes and tones.  Well composed for maximum impact, too.', '2005-10-02 00:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753207, 236303, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Complex and simple at the same time.</td>', 'Nice.  Complex and simple at the same time.', '2005-10-02 00:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753209, 235869, 42808, '<td valign="top">good angle and perspective--i like it</td>', 'good angle and perspective--i like it', '2005-10-02 01:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753211, 235924, 42808, '<td valign="top">this makes a good snapshot, good coloring and contrast</td>', 'this makes a good snapshot, good coloring and contrast', '2005-10-02 01:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753212, 236147, 42808, '<td valign="top">twilight zone type of image--sorta cool--i really like the composition in background</td>', 'twilight zone type of image--sorta cool--i really like the composition in background', '2005-10-02 01:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753213, 236573, 42808, '<td valign="top">this is a rare shot--i''ve never seen an actual shot of a church service, though i''m always tempted to shoot something like this but never had the nerve. i like the perspective and angle. Good bravery.</td>', 'this is a rare shot--i''ve never seen an actual shot of a church service, though i''m always tempted to shoot something like this but never had the nerve. i like the perspective and angle. Good bravery.', '2005-10-02 01:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753217, 236059, 42808, '<td valign="top">good handle on DOF, contrast and color and overall quality--but is it actually from the ground? i would have lowered the camera more to ground to see stems and somehow still view background, though maybe tricky.</td>', 'good handle on DOF, contrast and color and overall quality--but is it actually from the ground? i would have lowered the camera more to ground to see stems and somehow still view background, though maybe tricky.', '2005-10-02 01:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753219, 235231, 35545, '<td valign="top">OK.  You got the perspective right, but what is nyctophobia?</td>', 'OK.  You got the perspective right, but what is nyctophobia?', '2005-10-02 01:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753223, 237415, 42808, '<td valign="top">great scenic capture and unique to see an actual rainbow. i like the haziness in upper background indicating water mist from the falls....somehow i wish the crowd of people were''nt there, but they do provide a sense of scale--great shot!</td>', 'great scenic capture and unique to see an actual rainbow. i like the haziness in upper background indicating water mist from the falls....somehow i wish the crowd of people were''nt there, but they do provide a sense of scale--great shot!', '2005-10-02 01:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753227, 237264, 42808, '<td valign="top">i wish i could actually see one of these....wonderful shot, though i think the bottom is bit too bright.</td>', 'i wish i could actually see one of these....wonderful shot, though i think the bottom is bit too bright.', '2005-10-02 01:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753230, 237230, 42808, '<td valign="top">great scenic shot</td>', 'great scenic shot', '2005-10-02 01:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753231, 236438, 33672, '<td valign="top">Clever, very clever.</td>', 'Clever, very clever.', '2005-10-02 01:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753232, 236965, 42808, '<td valign="top">cool image, though i''d like to see this actually moving--slower shutter. i''d also crop the bottow portion, probably 1/3 from bottom for more visual interest.</td>', 'cool image, though i''d like to see this actually moving--slower shutter. i''d also crop the bottow portion, probably 1/3 from bottom for more visual interest.', '2005-10-02 01:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753235, 235059, 42808, '<td valign="top">very good capture, tones and contrast---like it alot--very unusual dark, heavy cloud tones really adds to this.</td>', 'very good capture, tones and contrast---like it alot--very unusual dark, heavy cloud tones really adds to this.', '2005-10-02 01:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753237, 235726, 42808, '<td valign="top">i like the coloring--the trunks look 3-dimensionally flatten, because of zoom? good potential</td>', 'i like the coloring--the trunks look 3-dimensionally flatten, because of zoom? good potential', '2005-10-02 01:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753238, 237013, 42808, '<td valign="top">sunburst dynamic!--just love it--has a biblical feel to it--great capture and wonderful tones/colors</td>', 'sunburst dynamic!--just love it--has a biblical feel to it--great capture and wonderful tones/colors', '2005-10-02 01:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753244, 236864, 40155, '<td valign="top">Great colours and the light and shadow on the petals is very nice.</td>', 'Great colours and the light and shadow on the petals is very nice.', '2005-10-02 01:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
