(1753322, 236988, 30364, '<td valign="top">I feel like I should be able to figure this out.  Best guess is wine, which would fit with the "from the ground up" theme.  Could also be brewing. It''s a very beautiful photograph, in any case ... love the lighting in the barrel store, the fine detail visible on the mezzanine floor, and the silky smooth appearance of the mixing tank.  It''s a very good example of meticulous exposure control.</td>', 'I feel like I should be able to figure this out.  Best guess is wine, which would fit with the "from the ground up" theme.  Could also be brewing. It''s a very beautiful photograph, in any case ... love the lighting in the barrel store, the fine detail visible on the mezzanine floor, and the silky smooth appearance of the mixing tank.  It''s a very good example of meticulous exposure control.', '2005-10-02 03:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
