(1753544, 236755, 7857, '<td valign="top">It''s... well it''s an unusual  subject isn''t it :o) The contrast between the yellow and the pale blue of the sky looks good. I wonder if this is something you''re not likely to see again and not have the chance to re-shoot, by which I mean the yellow could maybe look a bit more vibrant if shot with the sun shining on this front side. Interesting shot, good luck.</td>', 'It''s... well it''s an unusual  subject isn''t it :o) The contrast between the yellow and the pale blue of the sky looks good. I wonder if this is something you''re not likely to see again and not have the chance to re-shoot, by which I mean the yellow could maybe look a bit more vibrant if shot with the sun shining on this front side. Interesting shot, good luck.', '2005-10-02 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1753551, 235250, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice chot, the deep blue from the sky works well with the darkness of the shadows IMO (and the thick black frame work well too).</td>', 'Nice chot, the deep blue from the sky works well with the darkness of the shadows IMO (and the thick black frame work well too).', '2005-10-02 09:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
