(1753555, 236972, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject, the gradient effect of the blue in the sky works well... Just a shame about that dark "smudge" in the middle. Good luck with this.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject, the gradient effect of the blue in the sky works well... Just a shame about that dark "smudge" in the middle. Good luck with this.', '2005-10-02 09:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
