(1754125, 237188, 44963, '<td valign="top">The perspective of this image captures the challenge wonderfully, the basics (exposure and focus) are excellent.  I was attracted to the colour, the object and the question it poses about shape, colour, friendliness and stimulation - all things important to young people looking up at things.</td>', 'The perspective of this image captures the challenge wonderfully, the basics (exposure and focus) are excellent.  I was attracted to the colour, the object and the question it poses about shape, colour, friendliness and stimulation - all things important to young people looking up at things.', '2005-10-02 18:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
