(1754142, 236746, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice minimalistic image.  The inclusion of the moon (it IS the moon, right?) gives an amazing sense of depth and balance to it.</td>', 'Very nice minimalistic image.  The inclusion of the moon (it IS the moon, right?) gives an amazing sense of depth and balance to it.', '2005-10-02 19:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
