(1754244, 237327, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice silhouettes. There seems to be a lot of noise in the sky.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice silhouettes. There seems to be a lot of noise in the sky.', '2005-10-02 20:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754274, 236505, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp at the business end.  I''m not sure this meets the challenge very well.  Also consider de-centralising the main interest point in your photos, they are more pleasing to the eye that way.</td>', 'Nice and sharp at the business end.  I''m not sure this meets the challenge very well.  Also consider de-centralising the main interest point in your photos, they are more pleasing to the eye that way.', '2005-10-02 20:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754291, 235137, 22735, '<td valign="top">The top of the windmill seems crowded. I think that this would be a better picture with the distractions at the bottom replaced with a bit of breathing room at the top.<br/> <br/>The colors are great. You got a beautiful day to show off this windmill.</td>', 'The top of the windmill seems crowded. I think that this would be a better picture with the distractions at the bottom replaced with a bit of breathing room at the top. The colors are great. You got a beautiful day to show off this windmill.', '2005-10-02 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754294, 235906, 22735, '<td valign="top">The way that this tower tilts in the frame doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'The way that this tower tilts in the frame doesn''t do much for me.', '2005-10-02 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754310, 236777, 42984, '<td valign="top">Strong silhouette and I love the colouring.  "The Ground Up" part is a little obscure and could cost you a few points in the challenge</td>', 'Strong silhouette and I love the colouring.  "The Ground Up" part is a little obscure and could cost you a few points in the challenge', '2005-10-02 20:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754314, 237126, 42984, '<td valign="top">An on-camera flash this close in shouldn''t have worked as well as this has.  Wel done.</td>', 'An on-camera flash this close in shouldn''t have worked as well as this has.  Wel done.', '2005-10-02 20:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754317, 235884, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the angles and lines. Almost wish that one light at the bottom wasn''t there, it just seems so out of place.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the angles and lines. Almost wish that one light at the bottom wasn''t there, it just seems so out of place.', '2005-10-02 20:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754488, 235446, 39821, '<td valign="top">Niceus Workus!</td>', 'Niceus Workus!', '2005-10-02 23:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754557, 236539, 39697, '<td valign="top">Cool.. I like this very much~! Especially the angle on this statue. The background has given me the feeling of ''storming'', perhaps the rain was came after the moment?? :D</td>', 'Cool.. I like this very much~! Especially the angle on this statue. The background has given me the feeling of ''storming'', perhaps the rain was came after the moment?? :D', '2005-10-02 23:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754561, 236055, 39697, '<td valign="top">Clearly can see the shape of horse with a contrasting lighting. Nice job!</td>', 'Clearly can see the shape of horse with a contrasting lighting. Nice job!', '2005-10-02 23:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754569, 236844, 39697, '<td valign="top">nice capture friend. But perhaps u may try with a wider lens, so the the sky more stand out and broad. :D</td>', 'nice capture friend. But perhaps u may try with a wider lens, so the the sky more stand out and broad. :D', '2005-10-02 23:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754600, 237021, 45268, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here. My humble suggestions would be warmer color temp, perhaps (stronger) fill flash and more of the green inside the frame. But I understand this is more of an opportunistic capture so there''s not much time to contemplate and execute!</td>', 'I really like the composition here. My humble suggestions would be warmer color temp, perhaps (stronger) fill flash and more of the green inside the frame. But I understand this is more of an opportunistic capture so there''s not much time to contemplate and execute!', '2005-10-03 00:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754606, 237380, 45268, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color contrast</td>', 'Nice composition and color contrast', '2005-10-03 00:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754607, 235438, 45268, '<td valign="top">Impressive effect. I personally would prefer more color saturation but that''s just me.</td>', 'Impressive effect. I personally would prefer more color saturation but that''s just me.', '2005-10-03 00:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754613, 236921, 45268, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color. Bravo!</td>', 'Great composition and color. Bravo!', '2005-10-03 00:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754628, 237360, 45268, '<td valign="top">I like the angle. My humble suggestion would be use of fill flash and smaller aperture.</td>', 'I like the angle. My humble suggestion would be use of fill flash and smaller aperture.', '2005-10-03 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754644, 235446, 45268, '<td valign="top">This works for me as far as the composition is concerned. I do however, prefer higher color sat. That''s just me though.</td>', 'This works for me as far as the composition is concerned. I do however, prefer higher color sat. That''s just me though.', '2005-10-03 00:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754711, 236573, 37961, '<td valign="top">Wow....this is just lovely. Im not catholic, but boy is this beautiful.</td>', 'Wow....this is just lovely. Im not catholic, but boy is this beautiful.', '2005-10-03 00:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754713, 236539, 37961, '<td valign="top">This eery, yet beautiful. I love the dark feel to it.</td>', 'This eery, yet beautiful. I love the dark feel to it.', '2005-10-03 00:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754780, 236968, 36324, '<td valign="top">Love the color. I would of layed down a bit more to get a stronger upward angle to make the ground up more dramatic. Still very nice</td>', 'Love the color. I would of layed down a bit more to get a stronger upward angle to make the ground up more dramatic. Still very nice', '2005-10-03 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754902, 236059, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s an original idea for the challenge theme; so much more interesting and thoughtful than a shot from the base of a tall tree or towering building.  Very nice composition, too.</td>', 'That''s an original idea for the challenge theme; so much more interesting and thoughtful than a shot from the base of a tall tree or towering building.  Very nice composition, too.', '2005-10-03 02:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754906, 236021, 42404, '<td valign="top">this is not a complete subject/ its more blank something than sky.</td>', 'this is not a complete subject/ its more blank something than sky.', '2005-10-03 02:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754907, 235515, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s well conceived and well composed.  A good idea simply but effectively executed.</td>', 'It''s well conceived and well composed.  A good idea simply but effectively executed.', '2005-10-03 02:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1754909, 236438, 42404, '<td valign="top">this isnt from the ground up...</td>', 'this isnt from the ground up...', '2005-10-03 02:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
