(1755235, 237389, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been there, but I think this is a big arch in a southern US city?  Is it St Louis?  Anyway, it''s terrific.  The feeling you''ve created is of a celestial pathway; light and somehow insubstantial ... sort of ''other worldly''.  I''m guessing the designer would approve of your photograph.  I do, too.</td>', 'I''ve never been there, but I think this is a big arch in a southern US city?  Is it St Louis?  Anyway, it''s terrific.  The feeling you''ve created is of a celestial pathway; light and somehow insubstantial ... sort of ''other worldly''.  I''m guessing the designer would approve of your photograph.  I do, too.', '2005-10-03 07:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1755261, 236031, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking photo.   I love the way it fills the frame -- gives it a larger than life look.   It''s crisp and sharp.   Nice sky.   I love it and think it''s perfect.  10</td>', 'This is a very striking photo.   I love the way it fills the frame -- gives it a larger than life look.   It''s crisp and sharp.   Nice sky.   I love it and think it''s perfect.  10', '2005-10-03 08:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
