(1757354, 235778, 39349, '<td valign="top"><b>Edit:</b> Okay after re-reading my original comment it was rude and I''d rather do this publicly than over PM''ing. <br/> <br/>My comment was rude and uncalled for and I apologize for that. This shot is in no way a bad shot at all. The DOF is right on, it is a clean and beautifully done study in b/w (as is all of your work) and for a picture of a pet very intimate and beautiful. The only real flaw in this shot that I can see is some of the whiskers on the right hand side are a tad out of focus but I''m sure your model was doing his/her best to stay still. ;)<br/> <br/>I hope you can accept my apology and good luck with this challenge. Oh, and for a cat picture it''s the most kick ass one in this challenge. ;)<br/> <br/><b>Original comment:</b> <br/>Not very original and not to be rude but this subject (cats/dogs) is, IMHO being totally over done as of late. <br/> <br/>With that said, the shot is clean and meets the challenge. I like the b/w conversion. 4<br/></td>', 'Edit: Okay after re-reading my original comment it was rude and I''d rather do this publicly than over PM''ing.  My comment was rude and uncalled for and I apologize for that. This shot is in no way a bad shot at all. The DOF is right on, it is a clean and beautifully done study in b/w (as is all of your work) and for a picture of a pet very intimate and beautiful. The only real flaw in this shot that I can see is some of the whiskers on the right hand side are a tad out of focus but I''m sure your model was doing his/her best to stay still. ;) I hope you can accept my apology and good luck with this challenge. Oh, and for a cat picture it''s the most kick ass one in this challenge. ;) Original comment: Not very original and not to be rude but this subject (cats/dogs) is, IMHO being totally over done as of late.  With that said, the shot is clean and meets the challenge. I like the b/w conversion. 4', '2005-10-04 02:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
