(1759636, 237312, 8891, '<td valign="top">Well Glory Hallelujah, Skip! Saw you try some skaters in DC... glad you kept at it....Great stop action and angle! Big congrats on your on first ribbon!  Hurray!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 04:50:58.</i></td>', 'Well Glory Hallelujah, Skip! Saw you try some skaters in DC... glad you kept at it....Great stop action and angle! Big congrats on your on first ribbon!  Hurray!', '2005-10-05 01:07:45.000000', '2005-10-05 05:50:58.000000', 0),
(1759641, 235242, 39163, '<td valign="top">In answer to the questions on what this is - it is an old shot tower inside a shopping centre.  The roof is a cone shape.  The shottower is a listed building in Melbourne and so when they built the shopping centre they had to preserve the building - so they have incorporated it into the design.  <br/> <br/>A shot tower is where they would make the little buckshot in shotgun cartridges, etc. in times gone by.  I believe it was done by pouring molten lead from the top of the tower, letting it form into drops and solidify before landing in a water container (I believe) at the bottom of the tower.</td>', 'In answer to the questions on what this is - it is an old shot tower inside a shopping centre.  The roof is a cone shape.  The shottower is a listed building in Melbourne and so when they built the shopping centre they had to preserve the building - so they have incorporated it into the design.   A shot tower is where they would make the little buckshot in shotgun cartridges, etc. in times gone by.  I believe it was done by pouring molten lead from the top of the tower, letting it form into drops and solidify before landing in a water container (I believe) at the bottom of the tower.', '2005-10-05 01:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1759644, 234740, 39349, '<td valign="top">NICE JOB ON 4th Mr. Slippy!</td>', 'NICE JOB ON 4th Mr. Slippy!', '2005-10-05 01:10:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1759646, 237396, 41522, '<td valign="top">Rob, This is beautiful.  I think I still prefer your architecture shots, but you have this style down!!!  The focus and colour is great.  I''m guessing that this will be seen elsewhere!!!  Good job.  Nice high finish.</td>', 'Rob, This is beautiful.  I think I still prefer your architecture shots, but you have this style down!!!  The focus and colour is great.  I''m guessing that this will be seen elsewhere!!!  Good job.  Nice high finish.', '2005-10-05 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
