(1759804, 237352, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I didn''t get a chance to vote in this challenge but this is an instant favorite.  Amazing view.  Wonderful choice of subject and I like how close you are to the one tree trunk.  It makes you feel like an ant or an insect crawling up it.</td>', 'Wow.  I didn''t get a chance to vote in this challenge but this is an instant favorite.  Amazing view.  Wonderful choice of subject and I like how close you are to the one tree trunk.  It makes you feel like an ant or an insect crawling up it.', '2005-10-05 01:46:32.000000', NULL, 0),
