(1759811, 237260, 19936, '<td valign="top">I think I need a rest from challenges.  I''m going backwards.  Really expected better of this one.  Thanks Cindy, Kelly and Michele for the comments.</td>', 'I think I need a rest from challenges.  I''m going backwards.  Really expected better of this one.  Thanks Cindy, Kelly and Michele for the comments.', '2005-10-05 01:47:52.000000', NULL, 0),
