(1759978, 235059, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well ... I should have guessed it was you Aznym!  So much of your sublime work lives uncomfortably at DPC, like using a good malt whiskey to make a scotch &amp; coke; sacrilege!</td>', 'Well ... I should have guessed it was you Aznym!  So much of your sublime work lives uncomfortably at DPC, like using a good malt whiskey to make a scotch & coke; sacrilege!', '2005-10-05 02:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
