(1760086, 236972, 28742, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this might''ve done better if it weren''t on the heels of a recent Perspective challenge - people tend to get tired of seeing things over and over. I didn''t vote in this or the Perspectives challenge, but I would''ve given this a 7 or 8. It''s great and I''m pleased to see you left your visit to Seattle with some great photos!</td>', 'In my opinion, this might''ve done better if it weren''t on the heels of a recent Perspective challenge - people tend to get tired of seeing things over and over. I didn''t vote in this or the Perspectives challenge, but I would''ve given this a 7 or 8. It''s great and I''m pleased to see you left your visit to Seattle with some great photos!', '2005-10-05 03:09:30.000000', NULL, 0),
