(1760980, 235778, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Louison:</b></div><hr/><i> This looks a lot like Lulu, who likes to sleep in the bathtub... Fun shot! Very nice detail in the fur. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>...how funny you found Lulu on DPC Louison! I just love the fact that someone actually recognized Lulu from seeing pictures of her on a completely different website! I hope she will not let this go to her furry little diva head!  : }<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 19:53:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Louison: This looks a lot like Lulu, who likes to sleep in the bathtub... Fun shot! Very nice detail in the fur.   ...how funny you found Lulu on DPC Louison! I just love the fact that someone actually recognized Lulu from seeing pictures of her on a completely different website! I hope she will not let this go to her furry little diva head!  : }', '2005-10-05 10:53:20.000000', '2005-10-05 20:53:59.000000', 0),
