(1761414, 237352, 25095, '<td valign="top">dude, congrats on the red.  I will be back in FT. Collins in Novemeber for the weekend but I''ve heard most of the colors have already changed so I probably won''t even go looking.  While growing up we had a cabin outside of Fraiser and loved going into Winter Park for the ice festivals in the winter and craft fairs in the summer.  You''re really making me homesick with all the great Colorado images...but that''s a good thing cause your images are exactly like I remember.  Great job.</td>', 'dude, congrats on the red.  I will be back in FT. Collins in Novemeber for the weekend but I''ve heard most of the colors have already changed so I probably won''t even go looking.  While growing up we had a cabin outside of Fraiser and loved going into Winter Park for the ice festivals in the winter and craft fairs in the summer.  You''re really making me homesick with all the great Colorado images...but that''s a good thing cause your images are exactly like I remember.  Great job.', '2005-10-05 13:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1761491, 234739, 37673, '<td valign="top">Well I thank those of you who saw the photo for what it was worth. Please note that this is a pure photo and NO POST PROCESSING was done here. I would like to congradulate the winners on some very fine work. Thank you again everybody for voting for my photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-09 16:03:42.</i></td>', 'Well I thank those of you who saw the photo for what it was worth. Please note that this is a pure photo and NO POST PROCESSING was done here. I would like to congradulate the winners on some very fine work. Thank you again everybody for voting for my photo.', '2005-10-05 13:35:48.000000', '2005-10-09 17:03:42.000000', 0),
