(1762580, 237260, 42100, '<td valign="top">Typically simpler subject matters make better candidates for negative space photos. You have so much interesting stuff going on in the subject area, the negative space takes away from it.  So in other words I have to agree with Tsheets.  You have some very nice contrast in your photo and it has a lot of potential, definately worth the time to try other composition edits.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Typically simpler subject matters make better candidates for negative space photos. You have so much interesting stuff going on in the subject area, the negative space takes away from it.  So in other words I have to agree with Tsheets.  You have some very nice contrast in your photo and it has a lot of potential, definately worth the time to try other composition edits. ', '2005-10-05 18:28:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1762617, 237312, 45226, '<td valign="top">"my intention was to shoot him on the playground, but, when we got there, i noticed another photographer shooting some guys at the adjacent skate park...somehow, that seemed to grab my attention ;-)"<br/> <br/>This could definitely confuse someone if this weren''t a photography site.</td>', '"my intention was to shoot him on the playground, but, when we got there, i noticed another photographer shooting some guys at the adjacent skate park...somehow, that seemed to grab my attention ;-)" This could definitely confuse someone if this weren''t a photography site.', '2005-10-05 18:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
