(1762694, 235427, 3554, '<td valign="top">I gave this a six. Technically it was a fine shot but the subject wasn''t particularly interesting and while it was an adequate interpretation of the challenge it didn''t wow me. Hope this helps.<br/> <br/>A 5 on my scale is "meets expectations." A 6 is beats expectations. A 7 or higher does at least one thing exceptionally well. A 10 does multiple things exceptionally well.</td>', 'I gave this a six. Technically it was a fine shot but the subject wasn''t particularly interesting and while it was an adequate interpretation of the challenge it didn''t wow me. Hope this helps. A 5 on my scale is "meets expectations." A 6 is beats expectations. A 7 or higher does at least one thing exceptionally well. A 10 does multiple things exceptionally well.', '2005-10-05 19:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
