(1762885, 235427, 7743, '<td valign="top">Compositionally I think you''ve done well, lining the drum and tree up on the diagonal to add depth.  However, the horizon is slightly tilted to the left and the angle of the beach is a bit distracting.  Maybe cropped a little too tight on top.<br/> <br/>Just an opinion though.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.</td>', 'Compositionally I think you''ve done well, lining the drum and tree up on the diagonal to add depth.  However, the horizon is slightly tilted to the left and the angle of the beach is a bit distracting.  Maybe cropped a little too tight on top. Just an opinion though. Keep shooting.', '2005-10-05 21:23:05.000000', NULL, 0),
