(1763193, 236144, 44172, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to say that I am shocked that this did not place higher and believe it is because so many thought it did not meet the challenge when clearly it did - in fact it was one of the most original "ground up" ideas in the challenge. A bouquet of flowers. They were just in the ground...and now they are up! I really wish this had done better - it deserved top 20 at least - in my opinion. :)</td>', 'I just wanted to say that I am shocked that this did not place higher and believe it is because so many thought it did not meet the challenge when clearly it did - in fact it was one of the most original "ground up" ideas in the challenge. A bouquet of flowers. They were just in the ground...and now they are up! I really wish this had done better - it deserved top 20 at least - in my opinion. :)', '2005-10-05 22:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
