(1769723, 234740, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skiprow:</b></div><hr/><i> incredible shot, slippy!  can''t believe i nudged ya out.  (and correct me if i''m wrong, but didn''t i comment on a similar shot in your portfolio recently?  i thought i did, but can''t find the comment anywhere...) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, LOL, I re-shot... see the description above. :-) I hid it as soon as the challenge title went up.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=232155" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35357/thumb/232155.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35357/thumb/232155.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35357/thumb/232155.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-08 10:16:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by skiprow: incredible shot, slippy!  can''t believe i nudged ya out.  (and correct me if i''m wrong, but didn''t i comment on a similar shot in your portfolio recently?  i thought i did, but can''t find the comment anywhere...)  Yes, LOL, I re-shot... see the description above. :-) I hid it as soon as the challenge title went up.', '2005-10-08 11:13:48.000000', '2005-10-08 11:16:08.000000', 0),
