(1770330, 237148, 31637, '<td valign="top">such a great placing..and you supposed to be new ? It took me 10 submissions to break 5. I like your composition here and it really fits the theme. I love old architecture..this is a favorite of mine.</td>', 'such a great placing..and you supposed to be new ? It took me 10 submissions to break 5. I like your composition here and it really fits the theme. I love old architecture..this is a favorite of mine.', '2005-10-08 16:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1771020, 235344, 37544, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Sometimes when I shoot for a challenge I dismiss the first idea that pops in my head. I do this because more than likely it was also the first idea that someone else thought of too. In challenges like these on DPC, there are soooo many entries you really need something unique to do well. After so long voters get tired of the same image over and over. I think that is the main reason for your score.<br/> <br/>Your comments: "I simply walked up to a maple tree, lined up the sun behind it, and snapped this shot. pretty simple" Maybe that says it all right there. woutji has some great suggestions. Take time to think about what you want to photograph. How do I want it to look?<br/> <br/>When taking a picture of a common item, make your picture so different it is like seeing it for the first time.<br/> <br/>I hope this was helpful<br/> <br/>Mandy</td>', '*Critique Club* Sometimes when I shoot for a challenge I dismiss the first idea that pops in my head. I do this because more than likely it was also the first idea that someone else thought of too. In challenges like these on DPC, there are soooo many entries you really need something unique to do well. After so long voters get tired of the same image over and over. I think that is the main reason for your score. Your comments: "I simply walked up to a maple tree, lined up the sun behind it, and snapped this shot. pretty simple" Maybe that says it all right there. woutji has some great suggestions. Take time to think about what you want to photograph. How do I want it to look? When taking a picture of a common item, make your picture so different it is like seeing it for the first time. I hope this was helpful Mandy', '2005-10-09 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1771332, 236999, 4159, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=9663" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/47/thumb/9663.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/47/thumb/9663.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/47/thumb/9663.jpg"/></a>  ... Both are brilliant.  Nice work.</td>', 'Reminds me of:   ... Both are brilliant.  Nice work.', '2005-10-09 04:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1771393, 236529, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thank You very much for your comments.<br/> <br/>I was wondering why this picture got so low score... it is the ceiling of the sauna taken from floor, the side wood is the wall.<br/>I am a little disapointed that people having doubts about meeting the challenge, they score low... I would have to make a hole in the roof for the next picture :)<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thank You very much for your comments. I was wondering why this picture got so low score... it is the ceiling of the sauna taken from floor, the side wood is the wall.I am a little disapointed that people having doubts about meeting the challenge, they score low... I would have to make a hole in the roof for the next picture :) Thanks again.', '2005-10-09 05:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
